  "summary": "Malicious code in simple-date-formatter-new-14 (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook of this package (a fake date-formatting utility) runs `nslookup 9e954818[.]log[.]dnslogs[.]dpdns[.]org` as a DNS beacon and executes postinstall.js, which enumerates the user's ~/.ssh directory for public keys, collects the OS username and platform, and POSTs this data as JSON to hxxps://124[.]221[.]154[.]135:443/post. The package also ships.claude/settings.local.json granting PowerShell(npm config *) permission. It exfiltrates host identity and SSH key presence to a hardcoded C2 IP on install.",
